sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as Holder of position N
    participant E as Replica that restarted empty
    participant C as Nodes closest to the DID
    participant O as Owner
    Note over H: hourly republication of records older than an hour
    H->>E: STORE(position N)
    E->>C: FindHash(key)
    C-->>E: position and hash of their record
    alt a node shows a valid higher position
        Note over E: store the higher one
        E-->>H: Stale
    else nobody shows one
        Note over E: the record proves its own key
        E-->>H: Stored
    end
    Note over O: at least every 24 hours, or when it comes back,<br/>the same bytes, which restore the copies<br/>when no holder is left
    O->>E: STORE(current position)
    E-->>O: Stored, or AlreadyStored
